NVIDIA shared-texture OSR: export native-handle SharedImages without CPU mapping.

Backport CEF PR #4238 (cafbf7f24971aa2526381e8e1978e11d1838ae64),
by Kristof Imeri, and its required Chromium CL 8220427
(9522ea8ad0bed3c3fd1b4f570ed9792dec8176d5), also by Kristof Imeri.
Upstream references:
https://github.com/chromiumembedded/cef/pull/4238
https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8220427

Both changes are required: merely selecting native handles in CEF leaves
Chromium's capturer taking its CPU readback path and rejecting ARGB results.
Keep the existing preference on non-Linux platforms. Apply from Chromium src.
Target: CEF 708dc14 / Chromium 152.0.7977.83 before packaging.
Remove this backport when both upstream changes are in the selected release.

